  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1: fixes GPU engine creation for NuGet consumers on Windows (framework-dependent apps got \"litert_lm_engine_create returned null\" with Backend=Gpu: the engine's runtime LoadLibrary of the GPU accelerators never searches NuGet's runtimes/win-x64/native folder; the resolver now pre-loads the companion DLLs there, as it already did on Linux/macOS). Managed-only fix — the native binaries are unchanged (LiteRT-LM v0.14.0). Full notes: https://github.com/OrihuelaConde/LiteRtLmSharp/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
